{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2021-07-08 02:00:00', 'title': 'TEZEPELUMAB GRANTED PRIORITY REVIEW BY U.S. FDA', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF., JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS ACCEPTED A BIOLOGICS LICENSE APPLICATION (BLA) AND GRANTED PRIORITY REVIEW FOR TEZEPELUMAB IN THE TREATMENT OF ASTHMA.'}